text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BrandonIntro {
    "Do you know anything about this\n"
    "stone chamber?$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BrandonDefeat {
    "That was uncalled for.\n"
    "You didn't have to be so rough.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BrandonPostBattle {
    "The Tanoby Ruins date back at\n"
    "least 1,500 years.\p"
    "But it's a baffling mystery as to\n"
    "why it was built in the first place.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BenjaminIntro {
    "A mystic Pokémon is said to sleep\n"
    "inside here.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BenjaminDefeat {
    "I'm not much good in battle.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_BenjaminPostBattle {
    "I hear there are other ruins like\n"
    "the one here.\p"
    "Might they be the resting places\n"
    "of other mystic Pokémon?$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_EdnaIntro {
    "Clifford is teaching me how to\n"
    "paint.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_EdnaDefeat {
    "We might get in trouble for being\n"
    "noisy here.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_EdnaPostBattle {
    "I said that I wanted to paint an\n"
    "old building.\p"
    "So Clifford brought me here.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_CliffordIntro {
    "Today, in addition to our lesson,\n"
    "we came to see the chamber.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_CliffordDefeat {
    "My, how extraordinary.$"
}

text SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_Text_CliffordPostBattle {
    "Ah, so you are studying Pokémon\n"
    "on your own…\p"
    "Yes, you certainly are quite the\n"
    "extraordinary person, indeed.$"
}
